Each field represents a different aspect of the IPsec configuration:

* `encalgo`: The encryption algorithm to use for IPsec.
* `hashalgo`: The hashing algorithm to use for IPsec.
* `ikeretryinterval`: The interval between IKE (Internet Key Exchange) retransmissions.
* `ikeversion`: The version of IKE to use.
* `lifetime`: The lifetime of the IPsec connection.
* `livenesscheckinterval`: The interval between liveness checks.
* `perfectforwardsecrecy`: Whether to enable perfect forward secrecy.
* `replaywindowsize`: The size of the replay window.
* `responderonly`: Whether the IPsec connection is responder-only.
* `retransmissiontime`: The time between IKE retransmissions.

