* LevelThreeContainer: Represents a container at the third level of the tree with an array of items.
* LevelTwoContainer: Represents a container at the second level of the tree with either an array of LevelThreeContainers or a single LevelThreeContainer.
* LevelOneContainer: Represents a container at the first level of the tree with either an array of LevelTwoContainers or a single LevelTwoContainer.

The JSON object is as follows:

